<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<StringTableFile xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <Name>conversations\c_bloom\item_butterfly</Name>
  <NextEntryID>1</NextEntryID>
  <EntryCount>14</EntryCount>
  <Entries>
    <Entry>
      <ID>1</ID>
      <DefaultText>This shiny, metallic frame feels warm in your hands. The glasses are opaque and blurry.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>2</ID>
      <DefaultText />
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>3</ID>
      <DefaultText>Briefly look through the glasses.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>4</ID>
      <DefaultText>Put on the glasses for a brief moment again.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>5</ID>
      <DefaultText />
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>6</ID>
      <DefaultText>Looking through the glasses, you get a hazy impression of an unfamiliar field. The vision wobbles in an odd way, as if you're seeing through the eyes of something that is flapping around. It makes you so nauseous that you have to remove the glasses.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>7</ID>
      <DefaultText>You get a hazy glimpse of the same field you saw before - or a very similar one. The flapping motion gives you a nauseating sensation of movement.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>8</ID>
      <DefaultText>Try to understand what you're seeing.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>11</ID>
      <DefaultText>Put the glasses away.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>12</ID>
      <DefaultText>By the timing of the wingstroke, you would guess the creature to be a butterfly of sorts. It appears to be flapping around, minding its own business, little of worth happening around it.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>14</ID>
      <DefaultText />
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>15</ID>
      <DefaultText>The view through the lenses is too hazy and unsteady for you to ascertain anything.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>16</ID>
      <DefaultText>Try again to understand what you're seeing.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>20</ID>
      <DefaultText>Through the glasses, the blurred vision seems to foreshadow the butterfly's movements: you see the effects of each wingbeat just before it happens.

A pattern of shadows seems to mark its path through space and time. Focusing on different aspects sharpens your view of its immediate future. The understanding is momentary, but powerful.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
  </Entries>
</StringTableFile>